<title>HONG KONG: Carr Indosuez sets Shanghai Ind warrants.</title>
<headline>Carr Indosuez sets Shanghai Ind warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carr Indosuez Asia (Derivatives) Ltd said on Thursday it had issued 84.9 million American-style call warrants on shares of Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$26.10	PREMIUM	 23.52 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.6139     GEARING	 4.3X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 28.NOV.97     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$26.10</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
